[
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_01_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.5667,
    "frames": 107,
    "text": "衝撃の光景を目の当たりにしてしまった女の子が……ヤバすぎた",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_02_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 1.8667,
    "frames": 56,
    "text": "先輩、彼女いるんすか？",
    "speaker": 8
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_02_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.5667,
    "frames": 77,
    "text": "と、文芸部の先輩に質問する女の子",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_03_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.1,
    "frames": 63,
    "text": "彼女は先輩と過ごす時間が大好きで",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_03_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.9,
    "frames": 87,
    "text": "バレー部が休みの日は、いつも文芸部に入り浸っていた",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_04_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.5667,
    "frames": 77,
    "text": "卒業が近づいた先輩ともっと過ごしたいと思い",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_04_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.3667,
    "frames": 71,
    "text": "最近はいつもより積極的になる彼女だが",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_05_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.2,
    "frames": 96,
    "text": "そんな先輩は同じく文芸部の上園先輩に好意を寄せており",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_05_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.8333,
    "frames": 115,
    "text": "文武両道で美人な先輩は、学年の男子全員の高嶺の花であった",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_06_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.1667,
    "frames": 65,
    "text": "先輩もまた、そのように思っており",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_06_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 4.3667,
    "frames": 131,
    "text": "彼女は、女として終わってる自分くらいが丁度いい、と先輩に提案してみるが",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_07_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.2,
    "frames": 66,
    "text": "そんなこと言うなよ。お前はかっこいいよ",
    "speaker": 11
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_07_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.7667,
    "frames": 83,
    "text": "と言われ、改めて先輩の良さに気付く女の子",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_08_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.3667,
    "frames": 101,
    "text": "そんなある日、昨夜から先輩からの返信が無いことに気付き",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_08_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.4,
    "frames": 72,
    "text": "部活仲間にあの先輩かとからかわれてしまうが",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_09_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.5333,
    "frames": 76,
    "text": "同時にウジウジしてるのはらしくないとアドバイスを貰い",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_09_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.0667,
    "frames": 62,
    "text": "遂に告白する決心がつく女の子",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_10_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.4667,
    "frames": 74,
    "text": "思い立ったらすぐに行動と文芸部に向かう彼女",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_10_02.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.0333,
    "frames": 61,
    "text": "そして思いを伝えるため扉を開くと",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_11_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 2.7333,
    "frames": 82,
    "text": "そこには大好きな先輩と、上園先輩が…",
    "speaker": 13
  },
  {
    "file": "/voices/sakuragi/manga_12_01.wav",
    "durationSec": 3.0,
    "frames": 90,
    "text": "作品の詳細は、動画の説明欄からチェックしてね！",
    "speaker": 13
  }
]